msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "versionMember is functional"
msgstr "versionMember 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionMember is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership is about exactly one concrete version artifact — a different version of the same lineage is its own membership relator, not a second member."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionMember 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好关于一个具体的版本制品——同一谱系的不同版本应有其自己的成员关系元,而不是作为第二个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "versionSet is functional"
msgstr "versionSet 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionSet is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership places its member into exactly one lineage, so a membership belongs to a single gmeow:VersionSet."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionSet 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好将其成员归入一个谱系,因此一个成员关系只属于一个 gmeow:VersionSet。"
